      "heroImage": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1527977966376-1c8408f9f108?w=1200&q=80",
      "problemStatement": "In the Cauvery delta belt, paddy blast and sheath blight disease can destroy up to 40% of seasonal yield if caught late. Traditional satellite imagery is hampered by monsoon cloud cover, while manual ground scouting is slow and labor-prohibitive across vast acreage.",
      "theBreakthrough": "MAMCET student founders Karthik Rajendran and Sowmya Natarajan designed a ruggedized, lightweight carbon-fiber drone equipped with dual multispectral optics. Instead of streaming gigabytes of raw footage to remote servers, their onboard neural network parses reflectance values in real time, delivering color-coded infection heatmaps straight to the farmer's WhatsApp within 10 minutes of landing.",
      "mifJourney": "Incubated in late 2025 at MASTeR Incubation Foundation, the team gained direct access to high-precision CNC routers, 3D printing, and the outdoor flight cage. MIF connected them to former ISRO scientists for aerodynamics optimization, facilitated their ₹10 Lakh TANSEED grant from StartupTN, and coordinated field trials with local farming cooperatives across Tiruchirappalli.",
