      "founderQuote": "MASTeR Incubation Foundation didn't just give us desk space; they gave us test cages, rigorous mentorship from veteran aerospace scientists, and the credibility of an officially verified Startup Passport that opened institutional doors across Tamil Nadu.",
      "quoteAuthor": "Karthik Rajendran, Co-Founder & CEO",
