          {
            "time": "00:45",
            "speaker": "Karthik Rajendran",
            "text": "Growing up near Siruganur, we saw farmers losing entire paddy harvests to sudden bacterial blight outbreaks. We realized that our autonomous flight controllers could detect vegetative stress days before the human eye could."
          },
          {
            "time": "02:10",
            "speaker": "Sowmya Natarajan",
            "text": "The hardest part was running inference on-device under strict battery constraints. In the MIF IoT Lab, we spent three months quantizing our PyTorch models down to 4-bit weights so an edge board could process 30 frames per second."
          },
          {
            "time": "04:30",
            "speaker": "Karthik Rajendran",
            "text": "Having the official MIF Startup Passport was a game changer for us. When approaching government officials and Farmer Producer Collectives, the verified QR code and institutional backing gave us instant trust."
          }
